<!--
  Adaptive foreground, 108x108, 72dp safe zone centred.

  Three notification rows, the last cut short, feeding a vermilion funnel.

  Spacing: 3 between rows, 6 between the last row and the funnel, so the funnel is a second stage not
  a fourth row. The funnel mouth is exactly the row width (36..72). The stem is 8 wide rather than 12:
  a thick short stem reads as a cup, a slim one reads as a funnel.
-->
